+          // внести new внутрь остальных case, и потом вынести GetChildrenSub и ReceivedSubjectPublish вниз под case
+          GetChildrenSub (hNoderef, (level + 1), v-iSubject).
+          ReceivedSubjectPublish(v-iSubject, v-iImpSub).
